				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "3b9b2205-abed-4665-932a-fd88204fe53f")
	)
	(text "The PSM712 is a JLCPCB basic part which makes it quite attractive. It's positive\nVRWM in this configuration is 12V which is a good margin above the 7.5V bus.\n\nIt should clamp positive spikes to 19V, and negative spikes to -11V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 59.436 68.834 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "3f1f998a-a915-465c-b993-374afc0f2f5e")
	)
