	(text "The MeterBus frontend is powered by the Morningstar device via the RJ11 jack.\nFrom testing, the Morningstar devices seem to regulate the battery voltage\nrather than supplying the full battery voltage. Morningstar also specifies a\nvalid maximum voltage of 15.5V in their documentation.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 59.436 120.142 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "f1640f7b-11f7-4b2a-bdff-6a335d1fccd5")
	)
